fixtures/zulip/ holds text extracted from Zulip's help center
(https://zulip.com/help/), saved on 2026-10-06 for an unofficial demo that is
not affiliated with Zulip. That content is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (fixtures/zulip/LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt). Zulip's notice reads:

    Copyright 2012–2015 Dropbox, Inc., 2015–2021 Kandra Labs, Inc., and contributors

Changes made: only the main content of each published page was kept, converted
to Markdown, with tab labels and Note and Tip callouts kept as plain text.
Nothing else was edited. Source: https://github.com/zulip/zulip

